Right now there are several theses that can look unrelated.

They're actually one system:

```text
                    WORLD
                      │
          observations / evidence
                      │
                      ▼
            VERIFICATION ENVELOPES
                      │
                      ▼
               EVENT LEDGER
            immutable + replayable
                      │
                      ▼
                WORLD MODEL
                      │
       ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
       ▼              ▼              ▼
    PRODUCTS       PROCESSES      EXPERIMENTS
       │              │              │
       └──────────────┼──────────────┘
                      ▼
                  LEARNING
                      │
              promote / reject
                      │
                      ▼
                   POLICY
                      │
                      ▼
                   BUILDA
                      │
                      ▼
                new products
                      │
                      ▼
                     GET
              public capabilities
                      │
                      ▼
