That is coherent.

And importantly:

**GET is not the company.**

**DomainNameChecker isn't the company.**

**Dell isn't the company.**

**AgentSEO isn't the company.**

They're experiments/products/sensors running on top of the actual system.

The actual system is:

> **an empirical software foundry that observes how software is conceived, built, discovered and used, and learns which processes work.**

That is the thesis I would freeze.

